{
  "name": "FB · Metrics Pull (WF5)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "cronExpression", "expression": "0 9 * * *" }] }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [192, 192],
      "id": "71d48e6b-198e-4b3b-9274-c6acd273c5c8",
      "name": "Daily 09:00 ET"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://rcjcgjlqzepicbwhnnjl.supabase.co/rest/v1/fb_settings?id=eq.1&select=fb_page_id,fb_graph_version",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpMultipleHeadersAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [400, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000001",
      "name": "Fetch FB Config",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "httpMultipleHeadersAuth": { "id": "E0rGNWmOCXvZ4oYb", "name": "LP Supabase Account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://rcjcgjlqzepicbwhnnjl.supabase.co/rest/v1/fb_secrets?key=eq.fb_page_access_token&select=value",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpMultipleHeadersAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [608, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000002",
      "name": "Fetch FB Token",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "httpMultipleHeadersAuth": { "id": "E0rGNWmOCXvZ4oYb", "name": "LP Supabase Account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Merge fb_settings + fb_secrets into one config item (same pattern as WF4).\nconst cfgRaw = $('Fetch FB Config').first().json;\nconst tokRaw = $('Fetch FB Token').first().json;\nconst cfg = Array.isArray(cfgRaw) ? cfgRaw[0] : cfgRaw;\nconst tok = Array.isArray(tokRaw) ? tokRaw[0] : tokRaw;\nreturn [{ json: {\n  page_id: (cfg && cfg.fb_page_id) || '',\n  graph: (cfg && cfg.fb_graph_version) || 'v25.0',\n  token: (tok && tok.value) || ''\n} }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [816, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000003",
      "name": "FB Config"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "gate-token",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.token }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty", "singleValue": true }
            },
            {
              "id": "gate-page",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.page_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1024, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000004",
      "name": "Gate (token + page)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://rcjcgjlqzepicbwhnnjl.supabase.co/rest/v1/fb_posts?page_permalink=not.is.null&page_posted_at=gte.{{ $now.minus({ days: 30 }).toUTC().toFormat(\"yyyy-LL-dd'T'HH:mm:ss\") }}Z&select=id,page_permalink,scheduled_date",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpMultipleHeadersAuth",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1232, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000005",
      "name": "Get Page-Posted (30d)",
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "credentials": {
        "httpMultipleHeadersAuth": { "id": "E0rGNWmOCXvZ4oYb", "name": "LP Supabase Account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose", "version": 2 },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-posts",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": { "type": "string", "operation": "notEmpty", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1440, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000006",
      "name": "Has Posts?"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://graph.facebook.com/{{ $('FB Config').first().json.graph }}/{{ $('FB Config').first().json.page_id }}/published_posts?fields=id,reactions.summary(total_count),comments.summary(total_count),shares&limit=100&access_token={{ $('FB Config').first().json.token }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1648, 192],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000007",
      "name": "Fetch Page Engagement",
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "executeOnce": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Join Supabase queue rows to Graph engagement by FB post id, emit fb_post_metrics rows.\n// Queue rows carry page_permalink like https://www.facebook.com/{page}_{post}; the tail is\n// the page-scoped post id, which matches published_posts ids.\n// Posts missing from Graph results (e.g. dev-mode ghosts invisible to the API, or >100\n// posts back) are skipped rather than written as zeros.\nconst graphPosts = ($json.data || []);\nconst byId = new Map(graphPosts.map(p => [p.id, p]));\nconst queue = $('Get Page-Posted (30d)').all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r && r.id);\nconst rows = [];\nfor (const q of queue) {\n  const fbId = String(q.page_permalink || '').split('/').pop();\n  const g = byId.get(fbId);\n  if (!g) continue;\n  rows.push({\n    post_id: q.id,\n    source: 'page',\n    reactions: (g.reactions && g.reactions.summary && g.reactions.summary.total_count) || 0,\n    comments: (g.comments && g.comments.summary && g.comments.summary.total_count) || 0,\n    shares: (g.shares && g.shares.count) || 0,\n    impressions: null,\n    reach: null,\n    link_clicks: null\n  });\n}\nif (rows.length === 0) {\n  return [];\n}\nreturn [{ json: { rows, count: rows.length } }];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1856, 96],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000008",
      "name": "Join + Map Metrics"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://rcjcgjlqzepicbwhnnjl.supabase.co/rest/v1/fb_post_metrics",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "httpMultipleHeadersAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
            { "name": "Prefer", "value": "return=minimal" }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.rows) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [2064, 96],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000009",
      "name": "Insert fb_post_metrics",
      "credentials": {
        "httpMultipleHeadersAuth": { "id": "E0rGNWmOCXvZ4oYb", "name": "LP Supabase Account" }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groupme.com/v3/bots/post",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ bot_id: '75c281957bf9655f47833a5248', text: '⚠️ FB Metrics Pull (WF5): engagement read failed — ' + (($json.error && ($json.error.message || JSON.stringify($json.error))) || 'unknown error') + '. If the Facebook app is still in Development Mode, metrics reads stay blocked until it is switched to Live.' }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.3,
      "position": [1856, 320],
      "id": "a5f1c200-1111-4aaa-8bbb-000000000010",
      "name": "GroupMe Alert"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF5 — Metrics Pull (rebuilt 2026-06-11)\nDaily 09:00 ET. Runtime config: fb_settings (page id, graph version) + fb_secrets (Page token) via LP Supabase Account credential — no hardcoded keys, no placeholders.\n\nQueue = fb_posts with page_permalink set and page_posted_at within 30 days (two-leg model: 'both' posts stay status='approved' after the Page leg, so we key on page_posted_at, NOT status='posted').\n\nEngagement comes from ONE Graph call to /{page}/published_posts (per-post object reads are blocked for this app), joined to the queue by page-scoped post id. Inserts a daily snapshot batch into fb_post_metrics (source='page').\n\nimpressions/reach/link_clicks are NULL for now: v25 deprecated the legacy post_impressions metrics (June 2026) and the replacement metric set is a follow-up once the app is Live.\n\nKNOWN GATE: while the FB app is in Development Mode, engagement fields return (#10) and the error branch pings GroupMe daily. Goes green automatically once the app is switched to Live.",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 460
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [192, -260],
      "id": "bfa34db6-8d46-40f5-9c1b-149ddd49e8bb",
      "name": "About WF5"
    }
  ],
